      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.93 (up from ₹0.66 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹3.51b (down 9.1% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹132.4m (up 344% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 3.8% (up from 0.8% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 11% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 3% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
