      "body": "The board of directors of NCL Industries Limited at its meeting held on February 13, 2026, declared Interim Dividend of INR 1.50 Ps per share (i.e 15 %) on the Equity Share of INR 10/- each for the financial year 2025-26. The Interim Dividend will be paid to the equity shareholders of the Company whose names appear in the Register of Members of the Company as on the 21st February, 2026. (Record Date). The date of payment/dispatch of Interim Dividend is on or before 14th March 2026.",
